# Pin the public registry regardless of the developer machine's global npm
# config — several local machines in this org point npm at an internal
# mirror (https://npm.synology.inc), and `npm ci` fetches straight from
# each package-lock.json "resolved" URL, so a lockfile regenerated against
# that mirror is unreachable from GitHub Actions / any host off the
# corporate network. See docs/operations/ci-gates.md.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
